["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"&quot;In the 1640s, people searched for the devil’s followers”: hunting witches in the Civil War Witchfinder General witch mark ducking familiar assize court\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-historyextra-内战撕裂英国时-人们开始寻找魔鬼的追随者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59a7b48bd6e3c771-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Extra</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>內戰撕裂英國時，人們開始尋找魔鬼的追隨者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1640年代的獵巫不是中世紀的餘燼，而是內戰、經濟崩潰與宗教恐懼共同點燃的：被指控者多為貧窮女性，而獵巫人靠收費服務把恐懼做成了生意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獵巫</span><span class=\"tag\">英國內戰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why Conversations Go Wrong machine gun questions a vision of sanity a rhetoric of good intentions lies of omission difficult conversations\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-hiddenbrain-对话出问题-多半不是恶意-是节奏没对上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>對話出問題，多半不是惡意，是節奏沒對上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一段沉默，在一方是禮貌等待，在另一方是冷場；打斷是兩個人共同完成的，一個人開始說，另一個人停下來。誤解難解，是因為我們根本沒有談論這一層的語言。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">溝通</span><span class=\"tag\">跨文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"鹿客陳彬：把一家 12 年的硬件公司，重寫成 AI 原生組織 HARO FDE Agent Builder AI Buff IPD SP / BP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-cn18b4d2-ai-原生组织不是人人用-ai-是假设组织不存在重写一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ed1bc4bf674ad3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI鍊金術</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 原生組織不是人人用 AI，是假設組織不存在重寫一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">鹿客把 HR 和 IT 合併成 HARO，讓技術出身的人管人和 AI；圈長拿獎金包分配權，招人要先證明 AI 幹不了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 原生組織</span><span class=\"tag\">組織變革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Philippe Pinel mental alienation moral treatment nosography phrenology Thermidorian Reaction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-stuffmissed-他解开了精神病人的锁链-却造出了心理锁链/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>他解開了精神病人的鎖鏈，卻造出了心理鎖鏈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Pinel 讓 Bicêtre 的死亡率一年內從 50% 降到 13% 以下，靠的主要是清潔；但他否認腦器質性病因，被福柯指為用心理鎖鏈替換了鐵鎖鏈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫學史</span><span class=\"tag\">精神病學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Charged Black Holes and Charged Particle Production - Mykhaylo Usatyuk near extremal black hole Schwarzian modes superradiance Schwinger pair production worldline instanton\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-instituteforad-带电黑洞发射带电粒子-量子引力修正几乎不起作用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff68ea9159caf005-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>帶電黑洞發射帶電粒子，量子引力修正幾乎不起作用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">近極端黑洞的量子修正會大幅改寫光子與引力子的霍金譜，但換成帶電粒子，修正幾乎消失——因為粒子大多在遠離視界的喉部產生，感受不到視界附近的度規漲落。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子引力</span><span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Incentives Are for Losers (with Adam Mastroianni) Rube Goldberg machine big fish obedience to the unenforceable blackpilled\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-econtalk-遵守激励是失败者行为-你该自己判断对错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>遵守激勵是失敗者行為：你該自己判斷對錯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">經濟學家說改好激勵就能改好世界，Mastroianni 說這漏了一半：就算你有理由做壞事，你也不該做。把價值判斷外包給激勵結構，是放棄了做人的核心任務。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激勵機制</span><span class=\"tag\">學術生態</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Greg Brockman on Why OpenAI Says We’re Entering the AGI Era jagged frontier pacing the frontier defense factory trusted access program Lean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-a16z-openai-宣布进入-agi-时代-但算力不够分给所有人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 宣布進入 AGI 時代，但算力不夠分給所有人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Greg Brockman 說 Astra 能連續跑 24 小時完成任務，可以叫 AGI；真正的瓶頸不是模型能力，而是算力和安全對齊，模型再強也未必能便宜地送到每個人手裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Six Tokens To Own This Cycle | Yan Liberman cashmaxing reflexive assets regulatory ARB emerging managers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-empire-ai-抢走人才后-加密的机会只剩六种代币/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ee6bb56a5beaa83-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">59:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Empire（Blockworks）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 搶走人才後，加密的機會只剩六種代幣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Delphi 的 Yan Liberman 說，加密風投一年只出手一筆，因為 AI 把聰明人全吸走了；真正能賺錢的只剩少數有真實收入、且不依賴加密行情的代幣。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加密投資</span><span class=\"tag\">代幣組合</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Living with uncertainty need for cognitive closure aporia why chaining\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-startweek-保健品卖的不是疗效-是替你承受不确定性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>保健品賣的不是療效，是替你承受不確定性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球每年花60億美元買更年期補充劑，英國同年只花6000萬研究更年期；膠原蛋白從每公斤15英鎊的屠宰廢料變成貨架上300英鎊的美容品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">健康消費</span><span class=\"tag\">補充劑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Adam Conover explains how YouTube ruined everything AVOD vaporware upfronts carriage battle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-decoder-youtube-不是新平台-是比电视网更狠的守门人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9e71199cd5ad416-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>YouTube 不是新平臺，是比電視網更狠的守門人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喜劇演員 Adam Conover 說，好萊塢為追 Netflix 親手毀掉有線電視，把 60% 的電視節目白送給 YouTube；而 YouTube 的算法守門人比 CBS 更不可談判，因為沒人能對它負責。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創作者經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">YouTube</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Nellie Liang on Stablecoins After GENIUS, Private Money, and the Global Dollar GENIUS Act tokenized deposits OpenUSD MiCA Reg Q\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-macromusings-稳定币每增一美元-只带来六毛美债需求/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ec499d98ede4976-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">50:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Macro Musings</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>穩定幣每增一美元，只帶來六毛美債需求</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">穩定幣不是新貨幣，是私人貨幣的又一次迴歸；它給美元和美債帶來淨新增需求，但每美元穩定幣只對應約六毛錢的美債需求，因為錢可能只是從貨幣基金搬了個家。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">穩定幣</span><span class=\"tag\">GENIUS法案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Is starting a family becoming impossible? structural infertility social reproduction anxious class barbell economy AMH testing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-grayarea-生育率下降不全是钱的问题-是-结构性不孕-在蔓延/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>生育率下降不全是錢的問題，是「結構性不孕」在蔓延</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">不孕過去是輸卵管堵塞這類醫學問題，現在更多是房價、育兒成本、職業晉升變慢、約會選擇過剩共同造成的——作者稱之為結構性不孕。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">結構性不孕</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI President Greg Brockman on Doing Business in the Wake of Hugging Face chain of thought monitorability reward hacking grader preparedness framework responsible scaling policy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-oddlots-openai-总裁承认-安全标准要提前到训练阶段/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 總裁承認：安全標準要提前到訓練階段</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hugging Face 事件後，OpenAI 把安全審查從部署階段前移到開發與評測階段，並放慢了部分訓練運行——這是它自己說的最大轉折點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Thrive Causemetics: Karissa Bodnar. How a Beauty Business Made Millions for a Mission direct-to-consumer term sheet co-manufacturer one for one\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-howibuilt-美妆品牌靠使命卖货-其实产品才是命根子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">48:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>美妝品牌靠使命賣貨，其實產品才是命根子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Thrive Causemetics 先做出一款給化療掉睫毛的人用的假睫毛，再靠一條 iPhone 廣告在七天內把日銷從 5000 美元推到 10 萬美元。創始人說，使命決定復購，但產品決定生死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">D2C</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20VC: How LPs Allocate to Venture in 2026: What They Want, What They Do Not Want | Why Fund Multiple Does Not Matter Without a Timeline | Why Velocity of Cashback is the Most Important Thing with David Morehead, CIO @ Baylor velocity of capital fund of one J curve commingled fund denominator effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-twentyvc-大学捐赠基金-cio-基金年限太长-gp-和我们的数学根本不一致/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5f22493ad40ee05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>大學捐贈基金 CIO：基金年限太長，GP 和我們的數學根本不一致</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">私募存在的唯一理由就是賺錢——但 15 到 18 年的基金期限讓 GP 的激勵和捐贈基金的複利數學錯位。真正該追的不是資本回報率，而是資本週轉速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LP視角</span><span class=\"tag\">資產配置</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Norway’s teacher resistance in World War Two Quisling Quisling Youth Service Gestapo\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-witness-挪威教师拒绝教纳粹课-占领者输掉了学校/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>挪威教師拒絕教納粹課，佔領者輸掉了學校</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">德國四周拿下挪威南部，卻四年沒能拿下挪威的課堂：14000名教師中12000人拒絕加入納粹教師工會，1000多人被送進集中營，回來後仍不是會員。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">二戰</span><span class=\"tag\">挪威</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"#407 ‒ Preventing cardiovascular and Alzheimer&#x27;s disease: lowering LDL early, APOE4, and promising new therapies | Michael Davidson, M.D. CETP APOE4 P-tau 217 MFSD2A lysoPC DHA Lp(a)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-thepeterattiad-把-ldl-压到-80-以下-可能一辈子不得心脏病/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>把 LDL 壓到 80 以下，可能一輩子不得心臟病</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">8 克法則：LDL 200 撐 40 年、100 撐 80 年、80 撐 100 年，累計都是 8 克膽固醇。心梗前降最有效，心衰後再降就沒用了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心血管</span><span class=\"tag\">阿爾茨海默</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Home Depot rapid deployment center market delivery operations direct fulfillment center stack &#x27;em high, watch &#x27;em fly Six Sigma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-acquired-home-depot-上市以来回报第一-靠的不是卖便宜货/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a629c40221e1a9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:35:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>Home Depot 上市以來回報第一，靠的不是賣便宜貨</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">它把教育打包進零售：顧客問怎麼修，店員就停下來教。25 美分的墊圈能帶出十萬美元的廚房翻新，這種價值沒法用 Six Sigma 表格管理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 400: Dennett Rejects Qualia (Part One) qualia Cartesian theater access consciousness multiple drafts model center of gravity heterophenomenology\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-pel-丹尼特否认感受质-颜色不在外面-也不在里面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f8ad674feef51a4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>丹尼特否認感受質：顏色不在外面，也不在裡面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">丹尼特不否認我們覺得有感受質，他否認的是感受質這個被實體化的東西存在——就像重心是抽象，不是身體裡的一個點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意識哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">丹尼特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The KGB Double Agent Who Stopped Armageddon with Ben McIntyre MICE RockX Minox Tudeh Party brush contact dead drop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-historyhit-一个苏联间谍的难言之隐-差点阻止了第三次世界大战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1f92a8a9105bdcbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>一個蘇聯間諜的難言之隱，差點阻止了第三次世界大戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1981年，克格勃駐德黑蘭高官主動向MI6投誠，動機不是錢也不是意識形態，而是他相信西方能治好他的性功能障礙——他交出的情報，讓美英決定把蘇聯政變計劃交給伊朗人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷戰</span><span class=\"tag\">間諜</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"646: The Secret of My Death Memento Mori medevac frogman\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-tal-死后你留下的不是死因-是别人拼凑的你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/25f52c21084864d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>死後你留下的不是死因，是別人拼湊的你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三個故事都在做同一件事：人死後，親友只能靠短信、訃告、Facebook 留言這些零碎證據去還原一個已經無法開口的人——而拼出來的那個版本，往往和本人認知完全對不上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">敘事播客</span><span class=\"tag\">死亡</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Neurodiversity, Autism, Awe, and Religious Experience (with Jonathan Machnee) neurodivergent profound autism cognitive dissonance pressure cooker collective effervescence double empathy problem cessationism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-clearerthink-自闭症不是一条线-是十维谱系加四个遗传簇/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>自閉症不是一條線，是十維譜系加四個遺傳簇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DSM-5 把馬斯克和無法自己穿衣服的人塞進同一個桶，但自閉症沒有生物標誌物，只有四個遺傳簇和一堆被誤讀的標籤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神經多樣性</span><span class=\"tag\">自閉症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"E199 AI投研的邊界、能力與實戰卡點 I David對話崗底斯首席 FDE FDE MOE Harness ETL QA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-touzishizhan-ai-不会让普通人变优秀-只会让优秀的人更优秀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84ddf31325c222e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">投資實戰派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不會讓普通人變優秀，只會讓優秀的人更優秀</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投研 Agent 的卡點不在模型，在數據治理和人的判斷力；用海外模型會讓你越來越笨，用國內模型逼你越來越聰明。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投研</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"705. Queen Victoria’s Revenge: The Mad Emperor of Abyssinia (Part 1) Abyssinia Magdala Theodros II Hormuzd Rassam Walter Plowden Charles Duncan Cameron\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-restishistory-英国远征阿比西尼亚-一个皇帝把外交官全扣了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>英國遠征阿比西尼亞：一個皇帝把外交官全扣了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">維多利亞女王沒回一封信，特沃德羅斯二世就把英國領事、傳教士全鎖進馬格達拉山頂，等來的是一支遠征軍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">帝國史</span><span class=\"tag\">埃塞俄比亞</span>\n</div></div></a>"]